/span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\"><img alt=\"Mug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a><sup>1</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\"><img alt=\"Mug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a><sup>3</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\"><img alt=\"Mug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a><sup>2</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\"><img alt=\"Mug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a><sup>4</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">3 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">Beer</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-2\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Liquid%29\">Water</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-3\">With Lemonade.</li><li id=\"w-notes-4\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Wine\">Wine</a>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Mirabell.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nMirabell: Welcome to the Horn of Plenty, <i>Player</i>. Sit down, have a <b>drink</b> or some <b>food</b>!<br/>\nPlayer: name<br/>\nMirabell: My name is Mirabell.<br/>\nPlayer: job / tavern<br/>\nMirabell: I am the owner of this <b>tavern</b>, which is known far beyond Edron.<br/>\nPlayer: drink<br/>\nMirabell: I can offer you beer, wine, lemonade and water. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a <b>trade</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: food<br/>\nMirabell: Are you looking for food? I have bread, cheese, ham, and meat. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a <b>trade</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: offer / goods<br/>\nMirabell: I can offer you <b>food</b> and <b>drinks</b>. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a <b>trade</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: news / rumors<br/>\nMirabell: Oh, there are so many. Just ask other travellers like you.<br/>\nPlayer: Edron<br/>\nMirabell: I think it is the best place in Tibia.<br/>\nPlayer: Thais<br/>\nMirabell: Thais will loose influence on Edron more and more.<br/>\nPlayer: Carlin<br/>\nMirabell: They should return to the Thaian realm.<br/>\nPlayer: Tibia<br/>\nMirabell: I think Edron is the best place in Tibia.<br/>\nPlayer: king / Tibianus<br/>\nMirabell: King Tibianus III should visit our beautiful isle more often.<br/>\nPlayer: army<br/>\nMirabell: Sadly most of them are too disciplined to visit my tavern.<br/>\nPlayer: Excalibug<br/>\nMirabell: I heard the Knights of the True Blood are looking for it on this isle.<br/>\nPlayer: Ferumbras<br/>\nMirabell: I heard horrible things about him.<br/>\nPlayer: Frodo<br/>\nMirabell: He's my cousin and lives in Thais.<br/>\nPlayer: Falcon<br/>\nMirabell: Ah, the honourable knights of the Falcon. My mother loved the old stories! I'd welcome knights of this caliber here, anytime!<br/>\nPlayer: time<br/>\nMirabell: It is 11:00 pm right now.<br/>\nPlayer: bye<br/>\nMirabell: Come back soon, traveller.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Mirabell</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["a-fathers-burden-quest","the-order-of-the-lion-quest","the-travelling-trader-quest","what-a-foolish-quest"],"pos":{"x":33174,"y":31801,"z":6}}